{"data": [{"author_id": "715731383063339008", "created_at": "2026-10-28T23:41:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115589904734535848"], "id": "2115589904734535848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Neuralink just released early clinical data on speech restoration, and the real-world milestone is staggering. A participant with ALS was able to achieve a speech-to-text output speed of 75 words per minute during their very first week, effectively restoring functional", "url": "https://x.com/yaw59041/status/2115589904734535848"}, {"author_id": "766879493474574337", "created_at": "2026-10-29T01:15:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115613369202065543"], "id": "2115613369202065543", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "On October 29, Elon Musk's Neuralink released new data: after ALS patients were implanted with the N1 brain-computer interface, they could speak using only their mind in the first week, reaching 75 words per minute with an error rate of only 5.8%. At the same time, Chinese teams https://t.co/waajos3a3n", "url": "https://x.com/NeuraBC/status/2115613369202065543"}, {"author_id": "2013613489798160388", "created_at": "2026-10-28T21:21:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115554694764605885"], "id": "2115554694764605885", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2265, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115534593147187397", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Neuralink just shared early speech restoration data for people with ALS. Here's what you need to know.\n\nOne participant in Neuralink's VOICE study reached 75 words per minute with a 5.8% word error rate. That came on a 125,000-word vocabulary, in their first week. Neuralink says https://t.co/2YgI5ogD25 https://t.co/u4iqnPXyzP", "url": "https://x.com/AGTPinsights/status/2115554694764605885"}, {"author_id": "134910622", "created_at": "2026-10-29T01:48:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115621743876329861"], "id": "2115621743876329861", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1182, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "🚨 THE SECRET TECH BILLIONAIRE CYBERPUNK CULT - SNOWCRASH\n\nSilicon Valley tech moguls like Musk and Zuckerberg are now actively funding technologies to recreate or escape into simulated realities - drawing directly from science fiction tropes and Philip K Dick's philosophical https://t.co/AknO11QeY6", "url": "https://x.com/nic_moneypenny/status/2115621743876329861"}, {"author_id": "2321130066", "created_at": "2026-10-28T22:46:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115576022120743308"], "id": "2115576022120743308", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Examination of Neuralink in Quantum States\nAuthor: Grok (xAI) – Executing User Directive in White Paper Format\nDate: July 18, 2026\nVersion: 1.4 – Quantum-State Analysis of Neuralink Interfaces  Intellectual Property &amp; License Statement\nCanonical White Paper format. Non-commercial", "url": "https://x.com/Tlockty/status/2115576022120743308"}, {"author_id": "1535224282908794880", "created_at": "2026-10-28T23:41:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115589799063273644"], "id": "2115589799063273644", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "脑机接口第一周，就比你手机打字快一倍。\n· Neuralink 10/28 公布：一位渐冻症（ALS）受试者植入后第一周，「想」出来的话每分钟 75 词，词错率 5.8%，词库 12.5 万词\n· 对比：普通人手机打字平均每分钟约 36 词（Aalto 大学 2019 年研究）\n· 但这是 Neuralink", "url": "https://x.com/RunBLDady/status/2115589799063273644"}, {"author_id": "983052664320745472", "created_at": "2026-10-28T23:14:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115582888942895402"], "id": "2115582888942895402", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1381, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115246446203064382", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Elon系日报 20261028\n\n今天最重要的消息来自Neuralink：首次公布ALS患者脑机接口语音恢复的具体速度和准确率。此外，SpaceXSI数据中心遭遇新的社区争议，Tesla正式启动越南招聘，俄罗斯总统普京公开评价Musk与Starlink。\n\n① Neuralink语音恢复取得重大进展：每分钟75个单词 https://t.co/mlrA6JzeTR", "url": "https://x.com/mylifeonmystyle/status/2115582888942895402"}, {"author_id": "2099325731121811456", "created_at": "2026-10-28T21:17:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115553441581858830"], "id": "2115553441581858830", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 112, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Neuralink 公布了脑机接口帮助渐冻症（ALS）患者恢复交流的早期数据。在这项探索可行性的研究中，一名参与者在植入第一周，面对 12.5 万词的大词汇量，语速达到每分钟 75 个词，词错误率 5.8%。不过这还只是单名参与者第一周的早期表现，设备仍属试验性质，尚未获得 FDA 批准。", "url": "https://x.com/Moblacksoil/status/2115553441581858830"}, {"author_id": "2009419296087396352", "created_at": "2026-10-29T02:13:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115628002080096260"], "id": "2115628002080096260", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3816, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "来脑机接口玩玩 https://t.co/LfuJPqS9rl", "url": "https://x.com/Azfg6w/status/2115628002080096260"}, {"author_id": "983052664320745472", "created_at": "2026-10-28T21:54:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115562788097564989"], "id": "2115562788097564989", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 998, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "🚨 Neuralink重大突破！渐冻症患者重新获得交流能力！\n\n10月28日，Neuralink公布VOICE临床试验首批数据。\n\n一名ALS（渐冻症）患者仅在使用第一周便实现：\n\n• 75词/分钟的语言输出速度\n• 5.8%的词语错误率\n• 125,000词的词汇库", "url": "https://x.com/mylifeonmystyle/status/2115562788097564989"}, {"article": {"title": "Princess Demographics, Core Human Weights, Recording and Using Human Memories"}, "author_id": "1390681852764164096", "created_at": "2026-10-29T01:46:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115621310441173046"], "id": "2115621310441173046", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 379, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/HmaPk0elmo", "url": "https://x.com/RichardKCollin2/status/2115621310441173046"}, {"author_id": "852245268389126144", "created_at": "2026-10-29T02:19:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115629624025841832"], "id": "2115629624025841832", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 9040, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "兄弟们，今天有点难受，昨天刚放量涨了一天，今天就低开低走给吐回去了，创业板直接跌了3.37%，半导体、存储一片绿，超4600只票在跌，就福建、脑机接口这几个题材还在硬撑。", "url": "https://x.com/Jwaher49783608/status/2115629624025841832"}, {"author_id": "1993457349991055361", "created_at": "2026-10-29T00:24:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115600580597219546"], "id": "2115600580597219546", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 434, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI时代，还需要背文言文吗？\n到了人工智能时代，假如你真能穿越进仙侠世界、武侠小说或者科幻电影，那确实不必再背文言文。", "url": "https://x.com/Johnsong8qgi/status/2115600580597219546"}, {"author_id": "118538128", "created_at": "2026-10-28T21:02:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115549768302891068"], "id": "2115549768302891068", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115478505484066944", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Could definitely be relevant for #BCI and an area of interest for me. https://t.co/oTibpaOKDZ", "url": "https://x.com/DrJGiddensRN/status/2115549768302891068"}, {"author_id": "111434885", "created_at": "2026-10